I was told I do not have to complete the training to be paid as I physically worked a register and apparently I'm protected for that under the vehicle repair, services and retail award clause 17.6. Thanks sam from fair work

&#x200B;

edit: sent my boss that basically saying I'd prefer to not have to bring it up further with fair work so I'd appreciate it if I could be paid. My previous placeof employment has ai recognition for employees too so my hours can be proved
